t, we’re ready to handle critical cases with expertise and compassion. From triage to treatment, we prioritize your pet’s needs, keeping you informed every step of the way.\nServing the pets of Brooklyn Park, Minneapolis, Maple Grove, Golden Valley, Plymouth, and surrounding areas, we are proud to be a trusted partner in your pet’s health and well-being.\nAbout Us\nLearn More About Our Brooklyn Park Location\nBrooklyn Park, MN\nEmergency and Referral Services\nHours:\n24/7\nThis location is open 24/7, providing round-the-clock care for your pet’s emergencies.\nAddress:\n8301 93rd Ave N\nBrooklyn Park, MN 55445\nAllied Angel Fund:\nDonate Today\nEach of our locations participates in the Allied Angel Fund. Learn more about the fund\nhere\n.\nContact:\n(763) 463-9800\npark@alliedERvet.com\nContact:\n(763) 463-9800\npark@alliedERvet.com\nContact Us\nBrooklyn Park\nEau Claire\nEden Prairie\nMinneapolis\nRochester\nHugo\nQuick Links\nEmergency Services\nSpecialty Care\nSurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nCardiology\nFacebook\nInstagram\n© 2024 – 2026 Allied Veterinary Emergency & Referral. All rights reserved.\nScroll Up",
